  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">OYO Gentlemen and Supergirls Phase II - Addressing GBV with teenagers in Ohangwena and Omusati</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FI">OYO Gentlemen and Supergirls Phase II - GBV:n vastainen hanke</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FI">Hanke on jatkoa Gentlemen and Supergirls -hankkeelle. Hankkeessa tarjotaan neuvontaa ja psykologista tukea sukupuoleen perustuvan v&#xe4;kivallan uhreille, sek&#xe4; l&#xe4;hestyt&#xe4;&#xe4;n tematiikkaa innovatiivisin tavoin. Gentlemen and Supergirls &#x2013;hanke perustuu nuorten tietoisuuden ja kapasiteetin kasvattamiseen sukupuoleen perustuvan v&#xe4;kivallan ehk&#xe4;isemiseksi mm. taiteen keinoin.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project empowers both boys and girls to address gender-based violence in their communities. The project aim is to ensure that women and girls know where to turn to for support and that the next generation of Namibian men do not become perpetrators of GBV. OYO has a counselling line and long experience in using the arts and school groups to spread awareness and empower young people to own their rights and voice.</narrative>
  </description>
